  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advisory and Analytical Activities to Support Public Procurement Reform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the proposed Activity is to provide advisory and analytical activities to support the Government of Indonesia&apos;s reform and improvement of the public procurement system. The Trust Fund intents to bring about international best practice and national knowledge to support the reform agenda being developed by the National Public Procurement Agency (NPPA). In particular it will focus on the areas of improvement of the regulatory framework and human resources development.</narrative>
  </description>
